  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T09:12:30.703782Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T09:18:51.943883Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d82e22aff354a51",
      "translationZh": "一直让我困扰的是，为项目微调模型之后，并没有什么特别便捷的方式来托管它：要么在本地运行，让 GPU 全天候运转；要么付费租用整台 GPU 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bff1a44f2c3b4c63",
      "translationZh": "虽然有基于 vLLM 的 LoRA 推理服务托管方案（AWS），但通常最终还是得为整个实例付费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e168acbcf8d601b",
      "translationZh": "我开始思考：如果基础模型与使用秩为 8–32 的 LoRA/QLoRA 适配器的模型之间，99%+ 的模型权重都相同，为什么每个适配器都需要独立的服务器？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b30c971940ebea7",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 已经具备高效实现这一方案所需的许多组件，包括批处理、内存管理和融合 LoRA 内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eff8bf90b218997a",
      "translationZh": "所以，我围绕这样一个理念构建了 Lorivo：每个基础模型只需一台 GPU 服务器，供多个 LoRA 适配器共享。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94db750ee7b9b7c0",
      "translationZh": "Lorivo 识别基础模型，并将其发送到运行该模型的 GPU 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "206212459c80f8e5",
      "translationZh": "适配器被加载到内存中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89b5ec381fb31cef",
      "translationZh": "你可以直接从 Web 应用获取兼容 OpenAI 的端点，用于推理 / 使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4695ca35c41b0ec9",
      "translationZh": "我还开发了一个 CLI，让上传/部署适配器尽可能简单，同时也提供了一个用于手动上传的网页界面。只需运行 lorivo login api-key 和 lorivo deploy ./my-lora，就这么简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e227081d891dea7c",
      "translationZh": "项目已经上线：https://lorivo.dev",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89c557d912a39aee",
      "translationZh": "目前我用自己的 GPU 来承载所有请求，因此可用的推理模型仅限于 Qwen 3.5 4B，它将始终保持 100% 免费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c919cf65e5ffe24",
      "translationZh": "我还有大约 1,000 的 AWS 额度，想用它来增加一些模型。不过，我不确定哪些模型对社区最有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "251cc2a797d5facd",
      "translationZh": "你们希望这里托管哪些模型？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84b499be551cc3ff",
      "translationZh": "对于 Qwen 3.5 4B，你也可以不使用适配器，直接使用基础模型。只需将模型设为 qwen3-4b，而不是 qwen3-4b:my-adapter。目前我允许使用 32k 的上下文窗口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01ae47aa0309422a",
      "translationZh": "我也有意不保存聊天记录或推理请求。唯一收集的使用数据是 token 数量和时间戳。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c97f83e8153ccce8",
      "translationZh": "很希望听到这里各位的反馈，尤其是关于架构、托管哪些模型会有用，以及这是否解决了你们实际遇到过的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17908fa7d3f37728",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/TheOneWhoWil 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
